# Freeze: Entity ledger txn table — unified scroll / width (hard)

Read **`AGENTS.md` → “Freeze: Entity ledger txn table — unified H-scroll / width”** before editing any matched file or the unified-scroll block in `src/app/globals.css` (`data-pl-ledger-txn-unified-scroll`).

## Do not (without explicit human approval in that chat)

- Edit, refactor, or “small fix” unified H-scroll, `--pl-ledger-txn-table-min-px`, split thead/body/footer width, or `syncDashboardRecentHorizontalScroll` while doing unrelated ledger, voucher, print, or theme work.
