## Proceed only when the human clearly asks

Examples: “txn table H scroll fix”, “footer stretch win”, “header body align”, “V scroll pe H reset”, “ledger width cut” — in **that same message**.

## Preserve (web + EXE + APK)

- One horizontal scroll: `[data-pl-ledger-txn-unified-scroll]` moves ribbon + split table + closing row + desktop footer together.
- Width win: `computeLedgerUnifiedTableMinPx` — natural ribbon/footer/pagination vs column sum; widest sets min width + proportional col scale.
- Unified mode: body `overflow-x-hidden`; thead no nested H-scroll; V-scroll must not reset unified `scrollLeft`.
- `--pl-ledger-txn-body-vscroll-pad` on header/fixed summary when body has vertical scrollbar.
- `data-pl-ledger-footer-measure-row` for footer natural width measure.

